<title>USA: DITA in talks for $240,000 in contracts.</title>
<headline>DITA in talks for $240,000 in contracts.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JUAN CAPISTRANO, Calif. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>DITA Inc said it is negotiating two international distribution contracts with anticipated combined annual revenues of $240,000.</p>
<p>DITA, which makes fashion eyeware, said both potential contracts are for distribution in Japan.</p>
</text>
